All copyrights, trademarks, trade secrets and other intellectual-property rights remain with their respective owners.

No ownership interest is transferred by this Licence.

No patent licence is granted except to the extent expressly provided by a separate agreement or necessarily implied by applicable law.

The names, trademarks and branding of SWORD Intelligence may not be used to imply endorsement, sponsorship or official affiliation without permission.

All rights not expressly granted are reserved.

7. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The Software may incorporate or interact with independently licensed third-party components.

Such components remain subject to their applicable licences.

SRSL-1.0 does not override third-party licences, copyright ownership or other legal obligations.

Where a component cannot lawfully be distributed under SRSL-1.0, its applicable licence shall govern that component.

8. TERMINATION AND REINSTATEMENT

Rights granted under this Licence terminate automatically upon material breach of its conditions, to the extent permitted by applicable law.

Where a breach is capable of remedy, the Licensor may provide written notice identifying the breach and allowing thirty (30) days for correction.

The Licensor may reinstate terminated rights in writing.

Termination does not extinguish accrued claims or liabilities arising from prior infringement or breach.

Lawful rights granted to compliant third-party recipients are not automatically terminated solely because an upstream distributor breached this Licence.

