This document defines the permissions offered for Non-Commercial Use.

A person who does not accept these conditions receives no permissions under SRSL-1.0 beyond those otherwise available under applicable law.

Commercial rights arise only through a separately executed Commercial Agreement.

No statement in documentation, advertising, repository metadata or informal correspondence modifies these terms unless made by a person authorised to do so through an effective written agreement.

